meta {
  name: Health
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/super-admin/v1/models/health
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{superAdminToken}}
}

docs {
  Everything wrong or about to be, errors first: models with no enabled route, routes the platform cannot run, missing or stale prices, failing routes, overdue retirements, switched-off endpoints that are still routed to. `healthy` is true when there are no errors.
}
